135
00:06:13,140 --> 00:06:14,920
Jingle bells, jingle bells.

136
00:06:14,940 --> 00:06:16,820
Okay, yes, that's right, yes,

137
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:18,820
but on Hanukkah, we sing,

138
00:06:19,260 --> 00:06:22,720
♪ Dreidel, dreidel, dreidel, I made you out of clay ♪

139
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:25,400
♪ Rudolph the red-nosed reindeer... ♪

140
