One, two, three, four.

190
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:44,800
Tequila!

191
00:08:48,340 --> 00:08:49,020
That's fun.

192
00:08:56,180 --> 00:08:56,860
Here you go.

193
00:08:57,700 --> 00:08:58,140
Thank you.

194
00:08:58,160 --> 00:08:58,940
You got there? Put it there.

195
00:09:02,660 --> 00:09:04,360
Definitely not easier with coins.

196
00:09:06,420 --> 00:09:07,020
Thank you.

197
00:09:07,220 --> 00:09:07,620
Thank you.

198
00:09:10,580 --> 00:09:11,380
Hey, hey, hey.

199
00:09:12,020 --> 00:09:14,360
Here, now I only owe you 49.50.

200
00:09:17,020 --> 00:09:17,900
Hey, Pheebs.

201
00:09:18,000 --> 00:09:18,160
Hey.

202
00:09:18,380 --> 00:09:20,660
If you want to get Joey a Christmas present

203
00:09:20,660 --> 00:09:22,320
